      "dcterms:title": "On local solutions of the Ramanujan equation and their connection formulae",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "MORITA∗, Takeshi"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20220606",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1203.3404",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We show connection formulae of local solutions of the Ramanujan equation between the origin and the inﬁnity. These solutions are given by the Ramanujan function, the q-Airy function and the divergent basic hypergeometric series 2ϕ0(0, 0; −; q, x). We use two diﬀerent q- Borel-Laplace transformations to obtain our connection formulae.",
